            "detailed_description": "<h1>GET READY FOR AN EPIC WITCHER STORY FULL OF CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/23e99c96c84e41172a7a7641c22e2f6c.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/e5a768f996d27d44badc99347dbde4a6.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/69b5f727848c8549d79ac90692c66dce.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/9bb9d29a0f4e1c1dc117488bb8afd137.avif?t=1793900434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras_big/9bb9d29a0f4e1c1dc117488bb8afd137.avif?t=1793900434 width=1560 height=600 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/48b0d24228cb36cd184a5e53c7f81885.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/3dd11505073c278f76eaff0aa49b2003.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/e5a768f996d27d44badc99347dbde4a6.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/69b5f727848c8549d79ac90692c66dce.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/9bb9d29a0f4e1c1dc117488bb8afd137.avif?t=1793900434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras_big/9bb9d29a0f4e1c1dc117488bb8afd137.avif?t=1793900434 width=1560 height=600 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/48b0d24228cb36cd184a5e53c7f81885.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292030/extras/3dd11505073c278f76eaff0aa49b2003.avif?t=1793900434\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p>",
            "short_description": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt — Remastered modernizes the acclaimed role-playing game with a range of upgrades and enhancements. Become monster slayer for hire Geralt of Rivia and journey across a dark fantasy open world in an epic quest to find your adopted daughter Ciri.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês<strong>*</strong>, Italiano, Alemão<strong>*</strong>, Espanhol (Espanha), Árabe, Checo, Húngaro, Japonês<strong>*</strong>, Coreano<strong>*</strong>, Polaco<strong>*</strong>, Português (Brasil)<strong>*</strong>, Russo<strong>*</strong>, Chinês tradicional, Turco, Chinês simplificado<strong>*</strong>, Espanhol (América Latina), Ucraniano<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 9,
                    "review_score_desc": "Overwhelmingly Positive",
                    "total_positive": 258803,
